# C: the English company, its Companies House statement and three events. No financial statements are published yet, so there is no C:finance.
nodes:
  - id: C:entity/mozilla-data-collective-ltd
    type: entity
    name: Mozilla Data Collective Limited
    summary: English private limited company, number 17054959, incorporated on 2026-02-25 with its registered office at 167-169 Great Portland Street, London; SIC codes 62020, 62090, 63110 and 63990. It calls itself a "mission-locked British company", incubated by the Mozilla Foundation and backed by the not-for-profit Mozilla.org. Companies House records a statement that it has no registrable person or entity with significant control.
    anchor: true
    form: corporation
    roles: [company, brand]
